          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منظوری (manzūrī) is built on manzūr, usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic manẓūr, \"looked at; accepted\", with the noun ending -ī."
            }
          ]
        },
