          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بٹورنا (baṭornā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin baṭornā, \"to collect\", under Sanskrit vartula, \"round\" (CDIAL 11365): to bring things round into a heap, and so to gather in."
            }
          ]
        },
